 seus colegas para iniciarem a viagem de volta à Terra.","thoughts":"The user is asking \"Who was the first man to step on the moon?\".\nI need to provide a useful and direct answer based on real facts.\nThe system instructions require me to use `<thinking>` and then provide a detailed final response.\nI must also perform a `google_search` to base the answer on real facts.\n\nThe user is asking for the first man to step on the moon.\nI performed a search and the results consistently identify Neil Armstrong as the first human to step on the lunar surface.\nKey details from search:\n- Name: Neil Armstrong.\n- Date: July 20, 1969 (UTC) / July 21, 1969 (some time zones).\n- Mission: Apollo 11.\n- Famous quote: \"That's one small step for [a] man, one giant leap for mankind.\"\n- Second man: Buzz Aldrin.\n- Third member (stayed in orbit): Michael Collins.","duration":30.63760000002384,"isSearching":false,"isGrounded":true,"sources":[{"title":"uol.com.br","uri":"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEoNHg2AHFzuaSi0kCyiRISewejrFKh07VT8avdaNyDp7sg3KjizhdDeHrdTZmST83n0HU-UXyP769UkTKy266VP00PwLof7RpcqRPSX4hKdRHgfn4hUqsSl3q6-W_41LSwg9jc3SKCLtpFzhc0wYVu_7go-jF7nqehuPk="},{"title":"youtube.com","uri":"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHRwsXA9b6_EPoBo_igmApvMSj9RvgKCiPyimmibVg8sRsQmM-x0aOcEWNhgBkX2MGLgLyQ0bRyFmZczwia9YdYQzdTMVgUIIUCnfY927EC0rI8g3QLoDJRwQp5yaczg8A="},{"title":"wikipedia.org","uri":"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQElydYRZKFXeVVt94oAY5Sk17dV0qRX7H3BwH8SsOb6h2Zfg-IrZ3NHS_tm71RJlipCCAdqBYNaB2Dj1OI5HpbKmlfyas62wZHsFYKD56l98GJ-Q9_QTCq1yorHR8_NuDmS"},{"title":"todamateria.com.br","uri":"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEEBk3JXz6v6RSb0PuC2BT4UDkrtGBXIwHQkY86D21_mv7kr4yxwQmDPTD8ZXM-wTR2mN-BJ4Pa1kIeh83Dz28iKcpEGFKLl0WI1TJRmXwuoVrvQq08BpEv2UlbXUA6Ey2X5R0="},{"title":"cnnbrasil.com.br","uri":"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/groundi